{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udca1 TWENTYONE \ud83c\udca1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>The ultimate gamble</strong> \u2014 <strong>your life on the line.</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t <strong>luck</strong>. This isn\u2019t <strong>skill</strong>. This is <strong>survival</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face merciless opponents, each with their own twisted rules and dark pasts. Every match is a battle where the stakes are nothing less than your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win or lose, there are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Deadly <strong>new rules</strong> with every challenger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc Dark, twisted <strong>stories behind every face</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf A high-stakes game where <strong>losing means losing everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have the guts to play? Or will the game take everything from <strong>you</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TWENTYONE \u2014 Bet your life. Play or perish. \ud83c\udfb2\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you sign in, you can't turn back.<br>I have to tell you that this <strong>isn't a regular TwentyOne Competition.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/card.png?t=1748321415\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733940?t=1748321415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/7cf726143d8d729d23adfc2ad4977abe9c44c9be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748321415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/00af8f787b50fa6cd2db0d483f156f88de636a5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748321415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item